":"mantian-q-3c5cf736a6778f82e410","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b532990698a1a69ad25e","layer":"original","quote":"后孙权号十万众攻新城，征东将军满宠欲率诸军救之","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"mantian-q-600ebe2871292deea210","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-e1a46a1eeb88500f5c92","layer":"original","quote":"权自将号十万，至合肥新城","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":15},{"id":"mantian-q-68662ceb5338803231ef","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-e1a46a1eeb88500f5c92","layer":"original","quote":"权自将号十万，至合肥新城。宠驰往赴，募壮士数十人；折松为炬，灌以麻油；从上风放火，烧贼攻具〖17〗，射杀权弟子孙泰〖18〗。贼于是引退","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":70},{"id":"mingdi-e-o039b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf6d1ed2ab463eadb39","layer":"original","quote":"五月，太白昼现。孙权入居巢湖口〖1〗，向合肥新城〖2〗；又遣将陆议、孙韶各将万余人入淮、沔〖3〗。六月，征东将军满宠进军拒之〖4〗。宠欲拔新城守〖5〗，致贼寿春〖6〗。帝不听，曰：“昔汉光武遣兵悬据略阳〖7〗，终以破隗嚣〖8〗。先帝东置合肥，南守襄阳，西固祁山〖9〗；贼来辄破于三城之下者〖10〗，地有所必争也。纵权攻新城，必不能拔；敕诸将坚守，吾将自往征之；比至，恐权走也。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":189},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8d6d7b03ef7e78c66434","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，权遣陆逊、诸葛瑾等屯江夏、沔口〖5〗；孙韶、张承等向广陵、淮（阳）〔阴〕〖6〗；权率大众，围合肥新城。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"zhulv-q-c6662a503490f6f162ea","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-1bcb6b62fd91ee9e1a9d","layer":"original","quote":"嘉禾三年，权与蜀克期大举；权自向新城〖12〗，然与全琮各受斧钺〖13〗，为左、右督","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41},{"id":"zhulv-q-d391e3b5a74a420c1faa","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-1bcb6b62fd91ee9e1a9d","layer":"original","quote":"会吏士疾病，故未攻而退","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":57},{"id":"zongshi-q-5332e816b24f3e1694a6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-03ea69a8190928bde76f","layer":"original","quote":"嘉禾三年，从权围新城，中流矢死","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":33}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
